[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5664380052","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123485#issuecomment-5664380052","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123485","id":5664380052,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUZ-UlA","user":{"login":"Faless","id":1687918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless","html_url":"https://github.com/Faless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-14T13:01:52Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:25:16Z","body":"Few extra notes\r\n---\r\n\r\nThere are IMO good reasons after this to move the content of the welcome modal, to be part of the loader tab (as a \"yellow\" warning?).\r\n\r\nIf we want optional autostart as mentioned in https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15143#issuecomment-5637838298, it can be added with something like:\r\n\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/misc/dist/html/editor.html b/misc/dist/html/editor.html\r\nindex e4b49e58c3..29d35716a3 100644\r\n--- a/misc/dist/html/editor.html\r\n+++ b/misc/dist/html/editor.html\r\n@@ -370,6 +370,11 @@ a:active {\r\n \t\t\t\t\t___GODOT_VERSION___ - <a href=\"/releases/\">Change version</a>\r\n \t\t\t\t\t<br>\r\n \t\t\t\t\t<br>\r\n+\t\t\t\t\t<label>\r\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t<input id=\"tab-loader-autostart-check\" type=\"checkbox\">\r\n+\t\t\t\t\t\tAutostart\r\n+\t\t\t\t\t</label>\r\n+\t\t\t\t\t<br>\r\n \t\t\t\t\t<button id=\"btn-start-editor\" class=\"btn\" style=\"margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; font-weight: 700\">Start Godot Editor</button>\r\n \t\t\t\t\t<br>\r\n \t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"btn\" onclick=\"clearPersistence()\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5rem\">Clear Persistent Data</button>\r\n@@ -868,6 +873,24 @@ const LoadStatus = (function () {\r\n \tbuttons.gameShow.onclick = () => showTab('game');\r\n \tbuttons.gameClose.onclick = () => closeGame(false);\r\n \tbuttons.gameClose.ondblclick = () => closeGame(true);\r\n+\r\n+\t// Autostart option\r\n+\tconst autostart = document.getElementById('tab-loader-autostart-check');\r\n+\ttry {\r\n+\t\tautostart.checked = localStorage.getItem('autostart') === 'true';\r\n+\t} catch (e) {\r\n+\t\tconsole.log(e);\r\n+\t}\r\n+\tautostart.onchange = function () {\r\n+\t\ttry {\r\n+\t\t\tlocalStorage.setItem('autostart', autostart.checked);\r\n+\t\t} catch (e) {\r\n+\t\t\tconsole.error(e);\r\n+\t\t}\r\n+\t};\r\n+\tif (autostart.checked) {\r\n+\t\tbuttons.start.click();\r\n+\t}\r\n })();\r\n \t\t</script>\r\n \t</body>\r\n```","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5664380052/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5817994930","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123485#issuecomment-5817994930","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123485","id":5817994930,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWseOsg","user":{"login":"MarianoGnu","id":1776044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYwNDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1776044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://