b.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-25T12:49:29Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T13:02:05Z","body":"> After rebase running the game does not seem to work at all\r\n\r\nI think this was either a problem with the rebase, or a cache issue as I can't reproduce in neither chromium nor firefox.\r\n\r\nIn any case, I have rebased and added a commit to help Firefox garbage collector on force close while the engine is running, if you retest please make sure to clear the service worker cache under the `application` or `storage` tab of the dev tools.\r\n\r\n> The browser tab name is no longer showing the window's title\r\n\r\nThanks for spotting this, I had completely forgot about it, should be working now.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5832641094/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5834179965","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123485#issuecomment-5834179965","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123485","id":5834179965,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABW76FfQ","user":{"login":"MarianoGnu","id":1776044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYwNDQ=","avatar_url